{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "养足各方面的精力，接着迎来了星期日的决战。", "text_idx": 264, "plain": "养足各方面的精力，接着迎来了星期日的决战。", "plain_idx": 264, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们必须要在明天早上之前把蛋糕做好。", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼呼，竟然带着过夜套装上学，\\n 感觉真奇怪呢……」", "text_idx": 267, "plain": "「呼呼，竟然带着过夜套装上学， 感觉真奇怪呢……」", "plain_idx": 268, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2921", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": " 如此，我们做好了通宵的准备。", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「大家都是带着这个打算来的吧」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼呼，真是像文化祭这类活动的前一天一样呢」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": "「呼呼，真是像文化祭这类活动的前一天一样呢」", "plain_idx": 272, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2922", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「即便是结女校这样的大小姐学校，\\n　在这种时候也会有人在学校过夜吗？」", "text_idx": 274, "plain": "「即便是结女校这样的大小姐学校，　在这种时候也会有人在学校过夜吗？」", "plain_idx": 275, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「恰恰是在这种时候才会这样啊」", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2923", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「像兰华校长就是会假装没看见的那种人。安洁以前也偷偷跟着她巡逻过」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": "「像兰华校长就是会假装没看见的那种人。安洁以前也偷偷跟着她巡逻过」", "plain_idx": 278, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2924", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈，原来是这样，我能想象」", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过，今天倒不是装作没看见，\\n　而是得到许可了」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": "「不过，今天倒不是装作没看见，　而是得到许可了」", "plain_idx": 282, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "出门前，我给上次问到的校长手机打了个电话，告诉她我们今天估计会在学校过夜。", "text_idx": 283, "plain": "出门前，我给上次问到的校长手机打了个电话，告诉她我们今天估计会在学校过夜。", "plain_idx": 283, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "校长也顺利地接了电话，自然就很有气势地批准了。", "text_idx": 284, "plain": "校长也顺利地接了电话，自然就很有气势地批准了。", "plain_idx": 284, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "哎呀，对话实在太过简单，看样子她还是一如既往的忙。", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「一定要做一个能让校长大吃一惊的家伙呢」", "text_idx": 286, "plain": "「一定要做一个能让校长大吃一惊的家伙呢」", "plain_idx": 286, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「毕竟她相当不好对付呢。这下不加把劲可不行了」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": "「毕竟她相当不好对付呢。这下不加把劲可不行了」", "plain_idx": 287, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2925", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁开心地笑了笑，看上去是真心觉得很开心。", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "也许正因为是今天这样的日子吧。", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "当然，明天以及之后的日子也是如此。", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁，我们走吧……」", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好的，少爷」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2926", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们笑着穿过了校门。", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过，距离大家到达还有一段时间。", "text_idx": 296, "plain": "不过，距离大家到达还有一段时间。", "plain_idx": 296, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们没有直接前往烹饪教室，而是不知不觉地在无人的走廊上晃悠了一会儿。", "text_idx": 297, "plain": "我们没有直接前往烹饪教室，而是不知不觉地在无人的走廊上晃悠了一会儿。", "plain_idx": 297, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「奇怪……」", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "回过神来发现安洁已经不在我身边了。", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁？」", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "本以为只要呼唤名字她就马上会从天花板上出现，但现在偏偏只有空虚的声音在回响。", "text_idx": 302, "plain": "本以为只要呼唤名字她就马上会从天花板上出现，但现在偏偏只有空虚的声音在回响。", "plain_idx": 302, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真是的……」", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我决定再转转看。", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我很久没有这样找安洁了。", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈哈」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "想起之前也有过这样的时候，那时感受到的快乐就又涌上了心头。", "text_idx": 307, "plain": "想起之前也有过这样的时候，那时感受到的快乐就又涌上了心头。", "plain_idx": 307, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有了有了……」", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，少爷」", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2927", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我在安洁曾经住过的房间找到了她。", "text_idx": 311, "plain": "我在安洁曾经住过的房间找到了她。", "plain_idx": 311, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「非常抱歉，一不小心就……」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2928", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没事，找到了就好」", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「很久没来这里了呢……」", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的，虽然您这么说，但那也只是大概一个月前的事……」", "text_idx": 316, "plain": "「是的，虽然您这么说，但那也只是大概一个月前的事……」", "plain_idx": 316, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2929", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我环视一圈房间。", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这里还是老样子，和以前一模一样。", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「自从安洁来了我家，这里就一直没有人在用吗……？」", "text_idx": 320, "plain": "「自从安洁来了我家，这里就一直没有人在用吗……？」", "plain_idx": 320, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「据说是这样。不过我也会时不时地来打扫这里……」", "text_idx": 321, "plain": "「据说是这样。不过我也会时不时地来打扫这里……」", "plain_idx": 321, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2930", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她轻轻地抚摸榻榻米。", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那看起来很小心的温柔动作，也许是因为那里留有一些回忆吧。", "text_idx": 324, "plain": "那看起来很小心的温柔动作，也许是因为那里留有一些回忆吧。", "plain_idx": 324, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真是一模一样呢……」", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2931", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就像铺开的花瓣一样」", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？」", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2932", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「之前来这个房间拜访安洁的时候，我就一直在想」", "text_idx": 330, "plain": "「之前来这个房间拜访安洁的时候，我就一直在想」", "plain_idx": 330, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁端坐在榻榻米上的时候，铺开的裙子就像花瓣一样呢」", "text_idx": 331, "plain": "「安洁端坐在榻榻米上的时候，铺开的裙子就像花瓣一样呢」", "plain_idx": 331, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就算变成了少爷的女仆，这一点也没有改变……」", "text_idx": 332, "plain": "「就算变成了少爷的女仆，这一点也没有改变……」", "plain_idx": 332, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2933", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我从那时开始就一直觉得安洁很可爱呢」", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「您又在奇怪的时候这么说……」", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2934", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈，抱歉抱歉」", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过，看着那不变的裙子化成的花瓣，我的胸口产生了奇异的悸动倒也是事实。", "text_idx": 338, "plain": "不过，看着那不变的裙子化成的花瓣，我的胸口产生了奇异的悸动倒也是事实。", "plain_idx": 338, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "仿佛心脏记得我们在一起之前的那种感觉。", "text_idx": 339, "plain": "仿佛心脏记得我们在一起之前的那种感觉。", "plain_idx": 339, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁又默默地在榻榻米上描画起来。", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「虽然感觉是很久之前的事了，但住在这里其实只是前段时间的事……」", "text_idx": 341, "plain": "「虽然感觉是很久之前的事了，但住在这里其实只是前段时间的事……」", "plain_idx": 341, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2935", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……」", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「少爷您果然和此刻的安洁确确实实地联系在一起呢」", "text_idx": 344, "plain": "「少爷您果然和此刻的安洁确确实实地联系在一起呢」", "plain_idx": 344, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2936", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那些日子造就了现在。", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这一点，适用于所有事情。", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以说……该回去了呢」", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好」", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2937", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁温和地微笑了。", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这份温和，只有“现在”才有。", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「少爷，非常抱歉。这次我们将前往烹饪教室」", "text_idx": 353, "plain": "「少爷，非常抱歉。这次我们将前往烹饪教室」", "plain_idx": 353, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2938", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在我们到达烹饪教室的不久后，大家也陆续聚集到了教室里。", "text_idx": 355, "plain": "在我们到达烹饪教室的不久后，大家也陆续聚集到了教室里。", "plain_idx": 355, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么感觉……人数比星期五还多……」", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那、那个～各位新来的同学，这样没关系吗……？」", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2939", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "三年级结女校学生", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没关系的，感觉要是不来反倒会是一种损失呢」", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "jt0002", "char_id": "結女生徒３年"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "一年级结女校学生", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁，我们会好好干活的」", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "jo0003", "char_id": "結女生徒１年"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那些星期五没来的学生也都异口同声地附和道。", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "一年级结女校学生", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「似乎还有很多虽然现在来不了，但过一会儿就会来的学生呢」", "text_idx": 366, "plain": "「似乎还有很多虽然现在来不了，但过一会儿就会来的学生呢」", "plain_idx": 366, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "jo0004", "char_id": "結女生徒１年"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真的……非常感谢」", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2940", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那么那么，来和我一起做蛋糕吧」", "text_idx": 370, "plain": "「那么那么，来和我一起做蛋糕吧」", "plain_idx": 370, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2941", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "一年级结女校学生", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好」", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "jo0005", "char_id": "結女生徒１年"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜呜，安洁像个老师一样……我感觉有些丢脸……」", "text_idx": 373, "plain": "「呜呜，安洁像个老师一样……我感觉有些丢脸……」", "plain_idx": 373, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mc0225", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不会不会不会，都说了没那回事的」", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "结果今天连万智老师都来了。", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「该说是……领头呢，还是监督呢，总之非常感谢您的到来」", "text_idx": 377, "plain": "「该说是……领头呢，还是监督呢，总之非常感谢您的到来」", "plain_idx": 377, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好、好了，再怎么说在休息日聚集这么多学生， 不但要用火，甚至还要过夜的话实在是」", "text_idx": 378, "plain": "「好、好了，再怎么说在休息日聚集这么多学生， 不但要用火，甚至还要过夜的话实在是」", "plain_idx": 378, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mc0226", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「也是呢。嗯，非常感谢」", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「突然接到校长的电话得知了这件事……我就成了监督。唉，再见了我的休息日……」", "text_idx": 381, "plain": "「突然接到校长的电话得知了这件事……我就成了监督。唉，再见了我的休息日……」", "plain_idx": 381, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mc0227", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过，休息日也能看到新吾，也算是个不错的额外待遇……嗯今天也很可爱……」", "text_idx": 383, "plain": "「不过，休息日也能看到新吾，也算是个不错的额外待遇……嗯今天也很可爱……」", "plain_idx": 383, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mc0228", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "总之最后的部分就当没听到吧。", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然说会稍微晚点，但隼太你快来增援吧！", "text_idx": 386, "plain": "虽然说会稍微晚点，但隼太你快来增援吧！", "plain_idx": 386, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好了，安洁，要从哪里开始做？」", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4124", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
