{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈，鲜奶油要到后面一点。还有，奶油的打发状态请做成八分发」", "text_idx": 393, "plain": "「啊哈哈，鲜奶油要到后面一点。还有，奶油的打发状态请做成八分发」", "plain_idx": 393, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2942", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "当然濑名同学和樱乃都在来的路上。", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "明明濑名同学休息日还得做兼职，却还要像这样来帮我们的忙，真是感激不尽。", "text_idx": 396, "plain": "明明濑名同学休息日还得做兼职，却还要像这样来帮我们的忙，真是感激不尽。", "plain_idx": 396, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「早啊，我来了哟」", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0397", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我今天也来了。小熊喵留在家里看家」", "text_idx": 401, "plain": "「我今天也来了。小熊喵留在家里看家」", "plain_idx": 401, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0438", "char_id": "みう"}]}
